WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.760 --> 00:19.520
♪ I notice every glance ♪

3
00:19.600 --> 00:23.520
♪ The way you look at me ♪

4
00:24.040 --> 00:29.160
♪ And what they're hiding inside ♪

5
00:29.240 --> 00:32.800
♪ I think we might be the same ♪

6
00:33.800 --> 00:37.000
♪ Hiding our true feelings ♪

7
00:37.080 --> 00:40.160
♪ Not wanting them to come out ♪

8
00:40.240 --> 00:43.480
♪ But the closer we get ♪

9
00:43.560 --> 00:47.440
♪ The more my heart wavers ♪

10
00:47.840 --> 00:52.240
♪ I want to surrender to every voice in my heart ♪

11
00:52.240 --> 00:54.360
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

12
00:54.360 --> 00:57.800
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

13
00:58.360 --> 00:59.800
Mr. Sam has caused trouble again.

14
00:59.800 --> 01:01.080
Again?

15
01:01.080 --> 01:02.680
Find a new nurse as soon as possible.

16
01:04.560 --> 01:06.520
I've been playing nice for so long.

17
01:06.600 --> 01:07.800
But in the end,

18
01:07.880 --> 01:09.160
you just can't afford it.

19
01:10.480 --> 01:11.920
I'd like to turn down this job.

20
01:12.000 --> 01:15.520
You have to pay a penalty of five times your salary.

21
01:15.600 --> 01:17.960
I'll work the full 120 days.

22
01:18.400 --> 01:20.080
Prepare to fall apart,

23
01:20.480 --> 01:21.440
Uttawadee.

24
01:37.479 --> 01:38.800
I'll leave it to you, Cream.

25
01:40.280 --> 01:41.360
Uh…

26
01:49.120 --> 01:50.520
Are you okay, Oh?

27
01:59.880 --> 02:01.480
Hello, Dr. Smith.

28
02:01.720 --> 02:03.480
Are you going upstairs to check on Madam?

29
02:04.080 --> 02:05.160
No.

30
02:06.520 --> 02:08.400
I'm just bringing Oh here today.

31
02:09.039 --> 02:10.039
Cream,

32
02:10.240 --> 02:11.360
this is Oh.

33
02:12.200 --> 02:13.720
She's a registered nurse

34
02:13.800 --> 02:15.800
from the neurology department,

35
02:16.240 --> 02:18.079
specializing in caring for patients

36
02:18.079 --> 02:19.640
with Alzheimer's and paralysis.

37
02:20.760 --> 02:21.920
Hello, Ms. Oh.

38
02:23.360 --> 02:24.200
Hello.

39
02:24.760 --> 02:26.280
You can head back now, Doctor.

40
02:26.360 --> 02:28.840
I'll go over the job details with Ms. Oh.

41
02:33.079 --> 02:35.200
You were supposed to start tomorrow, right?

42
02:36.160 --> 02:38.280
Or can you start this evening?

43
02:41.520 --> 02:43.480
Yes, that's fine.

44
02:49.600 --> 02:51.560
Mrs. Pinthong usually wakes up around 7 a.m.

45
02:51.760 --> 02:54.040
The housekeepers prepare breakfast at 7:30.

46
02:54.360 --> 02:56.160
After Madam has breakfast and takes her medication,

47
02:56.160 --> 02:58.200
you'll usually take her out to the garden for some fresh air

48
02:58.200 --> 02:59.760
for about half an hour to an hour.

49
02:59.920 --> 03:02.280
After that, she likes being read to.

50
03:03.600 --> 03:05.160
Is there anything else she likes

51
03:05.240 --> 03:07.000
besides being read to?

52
03:09.520 --> 03:10.680
Listening to music.

53
03:10.760 --> 03:12.160
She likes having someone play music for her.

54
03:15.680 --> 03:17.680
As for the other members of the household,

55
03:18.360 --> 03:20.280
there's Ms. Nueng, Ms. Song's older sister.

56
03:20.880 --> 03:21.800
She's very kind,

57
03:21.960 --> 03:24.520
so if anything is bothering you, you can talk to her.

58
03:25.280 --> 03:26.560
But only if she's in the mood.

59
03:28.280 --> 03:30.560
Then there's Mr. Sam, the youngest brother.

60
03:31.320 --> 03:32.800
Avoid him if you can.

61
03:33.760 --> 03:35.680
I've heard about him from Smith.

62
03:37.040 --> 03:38.960
You've already met Ms. Song.

63
03:39.040 --> 03:40.560
She's the middle child.

64
03:41.360 --> 03:43.360
She's gone back to work already.

65
03:43.440 --> 03:44.400
She's very busy,

66
03:44.480 --> 03:46.160
so she doesn't come home often.

67
03:55.400 --> 03:56.760
And Mr. Methanee…

68
03:58.120 --> 03:59.280
has passed away.

69
04:09.160 --> 04:10.240
This way, please.

70
04:17.399 --> 04:18.440
Thank you.

71
04:25.360 --> 04:26.680
This is Madam's room.

72
04:29.720 --> 04:31.040
Wok.

73
04:31.560 --> 04:32.800
Pork.

74
04:32.880 --> 04:35.200
Vegetables. Delicious dipping sauce.

75
04:35.760 --> 04:37.040
She's watching TV.

76
04:47.120 --> 04:48.480
Do you have any questions, Ms. Oh?

77
04:49.200 --> 04:49.960
No.

78
04:50.680 --> 04:52.040
Then let's get your bags

79
04:52.040 --> 04:53.400
and take you to your room.

80
04:57.400 --> 04:58.280
This way, please.

81
05:06.360 --> 05:07.520
This is your room.

82
05:07.720 --> 05:09.840
If you need anything, just let me know.

83
05:09.920 --> 05:10.840
Okay.

84
05:11.400 --> 05:13.520
Right, I almost forgot something.

85
05:13.760 --> 05:14.320
Yes?

86
05:14.720 --> 05:18.080
Please wear your regular clothes while you're working here.

87
05:18.160 --> 05:20.600
We don't want Madam to feel like she's a patient.

88
05:21.880 --> 05:24.680
And the nurse I saw earlier?

89
05:24.920 --> 05:27.120
She's a part-time nurse.

90
05:27.240 --> 05:28.240
I see.

91
05:29.280 --> 05:30.960
Ms. Cream,

92
05:31.240 --> 05:32.960
you don't have to be so formal with me.

93
05:33.120 --> 05:34.520
Just call me Oh.

94
05:35.159 --> 05:36.080
Sure.

95
05:36.159 --> 05:39.480
Then just call me Cream. We're probably around the same age anyway.

96
05:40.159 --> 05:41.000
Okay.

97
05:41.200 --> 05:43.080
I'll get back to work now.

98
05:44.520 --> 05:45.680
Thank you.

99
05:50.440 --> 05:51.960
OH

100
05:56.960 --> 05:58.880
Hey, Oh! How's it going?

101
05:59.040 --> 06:00.120
Is your employer treating you okay?

102
06:02.440 --> 06:04.960
Well… sort of.

103
06:08.520 --> 06:09.600
Ong,

104
06:09.920 --> 06:12.680
they want me to dress casually here. No uniform.

105
06:13.240 --> 06:14.560
Send me the address.

106
06:14.640 --> 06:16.240
I'll ship some clothes over.

107
06:16.320 --> 06:17.640
They'll look stunning on you!

108
06:18.280 --> 06:20.080
Thank you, Miss Seller.

109
06:20.760 --> 06:23.280
So, how's Mom?

110
06:23.520 --> 06:25.560
Her condition is stable.

111
06:25.640 --> 06:28.040
I'm keeping a close eye on her,

112
06:28.120 --> 06:29.560
so don't worry.

113
06:30.120 --> 06:30.960
Okay.

114
06:31.040 --> 06:32.000
Mm-hmm.

115
06:32.080 --> 06:32.960
Good.

116
06:33.040 --> 06:33.960
Bye-bye.

117
07:17.120 --> 07:18.240
A printer?

118
07:18.560 --> 07:19.560
That's right.

119
07:19.640 --> 07:21.160
Could you help me?

120
07:21.240 --> 07:22.080
Oh, sure.

121
07:22.160 --> 07:24.000
Send me the file, and I'll take care of it.

122
07:24.760 --> 07:25.920
Is it a document?

123
07:26.240 --> 07:27.320
It's a set of photos.

124
07:42.480 --> 07:43.400
Uh…

125
07:46.600 --> 07:48.920
These are photos of the family members.

126
07:50.920 --> 07:52.640
What are you going to use them for?

127
07:53.360 --> 07:55.440
It's one of the brain-training activities.

128
07:57.400 --> 07:58.440
I see.

129
09:32.600 --> 09:34.040
What do you think you're doing?

130
09:34.120 --> 09:35.320
Ms. Kasira?

131
09:39.000 --> 09:40.320
First night here,

132
09:40.400 --> 09:42.360
and you're already trying to hurt the homeowner?

133
09:42.920 --> 09:44.440
I thought you were a thief!

134
09:44.520 --> 09:46.400
My house has tight security.

135
09:46.960 --> 09:49.240
A thief wouldn't get in so easily.

136
09:49.520 --> 09:51.240
How was I supposed to know?

137
09:51.320 --> 09:53.080
Besides, I didn't expect you to come home.

138
09:53.400 --> 09:55.640
Why? Can't I come back to my own house?

139
09:56.600 --> 09:58.880
I thought you usually stay somewhere else.

140
09:58.960 --> 10:00.160
That's my business.

141
10:00.520 --> 10:01.880
Whether I come back or not

142
10:02.640 --> 10:03.960
has nothing to do with you.

143
10:08.120 --> 10:09.040
Or…

144
10:12.600 --> 10:14.240
are you offering me a special service?

145
10:24.360 --> 10:26.040
If you want a designer bag,

146
10:26.800 --> 10:28.040
I can get you one.

147
10:31.240 --> 10:32.080
Thank you,

148
10:32.880 --> 10:33.880
but you can keep it.

149
10:34.960 --> 10:36.880
I'm here as a nurse

150
10:37.520 --> 10:38.920
to take care of your mother.

151
10:39.480 --> 10:42.360
Did you really think I'd trust you to take care of my mother?

152
10:43.280 --> 10:44.840
If you don't trust me,

153
10:44.920 --> 10:46.400
why are you keeping me here?

154
10:48.560 --> 10:49.880
Don't put it that way.

155
10:50.920 --> 10:53.560
Someone like you isn't worth keeping around.

156
10:55.880 --> 10:58.600
I just need someone to care for my mother.

157
11:01.680 --> 11:03.440
Then you can rest assured.

158
11:04.040 --> 11:05.720
For the next 120 days,

159
11:06.320 --> 11:09.280
your mother will be well cared for.

160
11:10.880 --> 11:12.640
Make sure you live up to that.

161
11:13.240 --> 11:15.520
Don't just say things to fool people.

162
11:17.800 --> 11:22.800
I won't let even the slightest mistake slide.

163
12:03.480 --> 12:05.120
Good morning, ma'am.

164
12:08.080 --> 12:09.160
Who are you?

165
12:09.240 --> 12:10.320
It's me, Cream.

166
12:11.440 --> 12:12.920
No, please don't!

167
12:13.000 --> 12:14.120
It's me, Cream.

168
12:14.880 --> 12:17.160
Porn's daughter, remember?

169
12:17.720 --> 12:19.040
Porn's daughter?

170
12:19.120 --> 12:20.120
Yes.

171
12:20.800 --> 12:22.080
No,

172
12:22.240 --> 12:23.680
you don't look like her.

173
12:24.560 --> 12:26.240
I do look like her.

174
12:26.320 --> 12:28.360
I've just grown up and gotten prettier.

175
12:30.880 --> 12:33.160
Okay, how about this?

176
12:33.240 --> 12:35.080
You'll definitely remember this!

177
12:36.960 --> 12:38.640
♪ The chicken is being grilled!

178
12:38.720 --> 12:39.880
♪ The chicken is being grilled! ♪

179
12:39.960 --> 12:41.440
♪ It'll be skewered, yeah! ♪

180
12:41.520 --> 12:42.800
♪ It'll be skewered, yeah! ♪

181
12:42.880 --> 12:44.160
♪ On the left bottom! ♪

182
12:44.240 --> 12:45.400
♪ On the right bottom! ♪

183
12:45.480 --> 12:48.080
♪ So hot, so hot, so hot! ♪

184
12:48.920 --> 12:51.320
It really is you, Cream.

185
12:54.240 --> 12:55.600
I'm glad you're here.

186
12:56.080 --> 12:57.400
Help me sit up.

187
12:57.480 --> 12:58.600
Of course.

188
12:58.960 --> 13:00.480
Ma'am,

189
13:01.560 --> 13:02.920
this is Ms. Oh.

190
13:03.160 --> 13:04.800
She'll be helping to take care of you.

191
13:06.880 --> 13:08.680
I'll take it from here.

192
13:16.080 --> 13:18.400
-What's your name, dear? -It's Oh, ma'am.

193
13:19.120 --> 13:20.720
-Is that comfortable enough? -Mm.

194
13:21.160 --> 13:22.320
That's good.

195
13:24.240 --> 13:26.680
And who are your parents?

196
13:27.080 --> 13:28.640
My mother's name is Malee.

197
13:29.800 --> 13:30.920
Malee?

198
13:34.280 --> 13:35.280
I'm sorry.

199
13:35.280 --> 13:36.480
I don't remember.

200
13:36.640 --> 13:37.840
That's all right.

201
13:37.840 --> 13:39.400
It's our first time meeting, after all.

202
13:39.400 --> 13:41.440
Why don't we get to know each other?

203
13:45.280 --> 13:46.320
Here.

204
13:47.640 --> 13:49.880
Do you remember who this is?

205
13:51.400 --> 13:52.760
That's right.

206
13:54.360 --> 13:55.800
-Does he look familiar? -Is this his name?

207
13:55.880 --> 13:57.160
That's right.

208
14:00.960 --> 14:02.440
And what about this one?

209
14:03.320 --> 14:05.120
She has long hair.

210
14:05.200 --> 14:07.360
-She seems familiar. -She has fair skin.

211
14:08.240 --> 14:09.480
Do I know her?

212
14:09.560 --> 14:10.600
Yes.

213
14:11.280 --> 14:12.680
Do you remember her?

214
14:18.680 --> 14:19.800
I like them.

215
14:25.040 --> 14:26.360
Ms. Song,

216
14:26.360 --> 14:28.680
are you really moving back here?

217
14:29.920 --> 14:31.160
Is there a problem?

218
14:31.920 --> 14:32.800
No,

219
14:33.200 --> 14:34.360
I was just surprised.

220
14:34.720 --> 14:36.160
What's so surprising?

221
14:36.480 --> 14:39.160
Well, you usually stay in the city.

222
14:39.280 --> 14:41.160
Moving back here all of a sudden…

223
14:41.720 --> 14:42.560
Don't tell me

224
14:42.840 --> 14:44.600
you don't trust the new nurse?

225
14:44.680 --> 14:46.520
Or are you worried Mr. Sam will hit on her?

226
14:46.600 --> 14:49.120
Or that she'll flirt with Mr. Sam?

227
14:49.200 --> 14:50.040
Or--

228
14:52.080 --> 14:53.520
I'll stop.

229
14:53.600 --> 14:56.120
Aren't you going to the office?

230
14:56.840 --> 14:57.720
No.

231
14:58.120 --> 14:59.840
I'll work from here today.

232
15:11.560 --> 15:13.160
You're going to work here?

233
15:13.640 --> 15:14.560
Mm-hmm.

234
15:15.640 --> 15:17.160
But you have a study.

235
15:20.000 --> 15:21.240
A change of scenery

236
15:21.320 --> 15:22.880
will help keep me motivated.

237
15:25.240 --> 15:26.280
As you like.

238
15:59.560 --> 16:01.120
What's in the blue box?

239
16:04.160 --> 16:05.680
Madam's medication for after breakfast.

240
16:06.440 --> 16:07.440
Hmm.

241
16:16.480 --> 16:17.720
And the yellow one?

242
16:18.880 --> 16:20.080
After lunch.

243
16:21.080 --> 16:22.080
I see.

244
16:24.520 --> 16:25.600
And the purple one?

245
16:25.680 --> 16:26.800
Ms. Kasira,

246
16:27.480 --> 16:29.760
are you here to work or to inspect me?

247
17:30.320 --> 17:31.440
Slacking off?

248
17:37.720 --> 17:38.960
Madam is asleep,

249
17:39.520 --> 17:40.880
and I have the intercom with me.

250
17:41.320 --> 17:42.080
Talking back, are we?

251
17:43.800 --> 17:45.240
How shameless.

252
17:46.280 --> 17:48.280
I thought you were only pretending,

253
17:48.840 --> 17:50.600
but now you're shameless too.

254
17:51.600 --> 17:53.040
Think whatever you want.

255
17:53.880 --> 17:56.040
There's nothing I can do about it anyway.

256
17:56.880 --> 17:58.480
Only 119 days left.

257
17:58.560 --> 17:59.720
I guess I'll endure it.

258
17:59.800 --> 18:01.120
Do whatever you want.

259
18:06.040 --> 18:07.040
Fine.

260
18:27.200 --> 18:28.080
There.

261
18:28.160 --> 18:29.440
That's what I wanted to do.

262
18:59.960 --> 19:02.160
You're not even bothered.

263
19:03.160 --> 19:05.000
You must have really thick skin.

264
19:17.560 --> 19:19.400
Go ahead. Play the victim.

265
19:19.960 --> 19:21.840
I'm good at hurting people.

266
20:02.240 --> 20:04.200
I'm not as stupid as I was back then.

267
21:09.040 --> 21:09.880
Cream,

268
21:10.160 --> 21:11.160
where's the nurse?

269
21:12.520 --> 21:13.520
She's in her room.

270
21:13.960 --> 21:14.960
Go get her.

271
21:44.440 --> 21:46.160
You called for me?

272
21:47.040 --> 21:48.160
Eat with me.

273
21:49.240 --> 21:50.880
I've already eaten in the kitchen.

274
21:51.680 --> 21:53.360
Your job is to follow orders,

275
21:53.440 --> 21:54.960
not defy them.

276
21:55.440 --> 21:57.920
My only responsibility is to take care of Madam.

277
22:00.720 --> 22:02.440
But I'm the one paying you.

278
22:02.520 --> 22:03.680
Have you forgotten?

279
22:06.720 --> 22:08.360
I don't like being disobeyed.

280
22:09.320 --> 22:10.800
So don't make me angry,

281
22:10.880 --> 22:12.120
or you'll regret it.

282
22:22.680 --> 22:23.840
-Cream. -Yes?

283
22:24.080 --> 22:25.480
Set another place.

284
22:27.400 --> 22:28.360
Of course.

285
23:05.680 --> 23:06.560
You may leave.

286
23:09.760 --> 23:10.600
Sorry?

287
23:10.680 --> 23:11.920
Leave us.

288
23:15.080 --> 23:16.080
Yes.

289
23:57.880 --> 23:59.000
Ms. Kasira.

290
24:04.920 --> 24:05.880
Eat.

291
24:06.800 --> 24:07.920
Eat it.

292
24:12.880 --> 24:14.400
If you won't eat on your own,

293
24:14.480 --> 24:16.160
I'll shove it down your throat.

294
24:17.040 --> 24:18.640
Don't think I wouldn't dare.

295
25:34.440 --> 25:35.400
I'm done.

296
25:35.800 --> 25:37.120
Are you satisfied?

297
25:37.560 --> 25:38.560
I'll be going.

298
26:16.880 --> 26:18.600
How long is she going to keep tormenting me?

299
26:22.800 --> 26:24.680
Just a few more days until I get a break.

300
26:25.440 --> 26:26.520
Hang in there.

301
27:39.320 --> 27:40.640
-Cream, -Yeah?

302
27:40.880 --> 27:42.200
Do you need a hand?

303
27:42.480 --> 27:43.600
No.

304
27:46.040 --> 27:49.720
And... don't you need to go downstairs and prepare breakfast for Ms. Song?

305
27:49.880 --> 27:50.560
No need.

306
27:50.760 --> 27:52.480
Ms. Song has already left for work.

307
27:52.760 --> 27:53.760
I'm off now.

308
28:07.200 --> 28:09.640
Hey, are you working tonight?

309
28:10.080 --> 28:11.480
I just got off.

310
28:12.480 --> 28:13.680
Is something wrong?

311
28:14.280 --> 28:15.800
Tomorrow's my day off.

312
28:15.960 --> 28:17.600
Want to grab dinner?

313
28:17.680 --> 28:19.600
I have so much to tell you.

314
28:22.080 --> 28:23.440
It's about Song, isn't it?

315
28:25.600 --> 28:26.640
Mm-hmm.

316
28:26.720 --> 28:27.800
Then

317
28:27.880 --> 28:29.320
let's meet around 7 p.m.

318
28:29.400 --> 28:30.560
Where are you now?

319
28:31.080 --> 28:32.320
I'm around Phutthamonthon.

320
28:32.400 --> 28:33.320
Perfect.

321
28:33.400 --> 28:34.520
There's a popular place

322
28:34.600 --> 28:36.120
with great reviews around there.

323
28:36.200 --> 28:37.320
I'll send you the location.

324
28:37.680 --> 28:38.800
Okay.

325
28:39.200 --> 28:40.160
See you.

326
28:40.240 --> 28:41.320
Yeah, see you.

327
28:41.680 --> 28:42.520
Mm.

328
28:53.680 --> 28:54.680
Here you go.

329
28:54.760 --> 28:55.760
Thank you.

330
29:08.480 --> 29:10.560
Can I get a whiskey on the rocks?

331
29:10.880 --> 29:11.840
Right away.

332
29:19.200 --> 29:20.520
Have you been here long?

333
29:25.920 --> 29:27.240
Can I buy you a drink?

334
29:28.440 --> 29:29.760
I'm good, thanks.

335
29:41.520 --> 29:42.440
This place?

336
29:43.040 --> 29:43.680
Yes.

337
29:44.240 --> 29:45.840
The clients requested to meet here.

338
29:45.840 --> 29:47.040
They said it has a famous signature dish.

339
29:47.920 --> 29:49.440
If it's what they want, so be it.

340
29:50.760 --> 29:52.160
Have they arrived yet?

341
29:52.720 --> 29:54.200
They're in the parking lot.

342
29:54.720 --> 29:56.280
We'll wait and go in with them.

343
29:56.640 --> 29:57.160
Yes.

344
30:05.480 --> 30:06.600
Are you here alone?

345
30:07.000 --> 30:08.000
This way, please.

346
30:08.080 --> 30:09.360
I'm waiting for a friend.

347
30:18.800 --> 30:19.560
I think

348
30:20.080 --> 30:21.680
we should head to the table first, Mr. Nont.

349
30:21.760 --> 30:22.760
Sure.

350
30:43.560 --> 30:44.680
That looks good.

351
30:45.200 --> 30:47.160
This is their signature dish.

352
30:50.960 --> 30:52.040
-Excuse me. -Yes?

353
30:52.120 --> 30:53.440
Another one, please.

354
30:53.520 --> 30:54.560
Sure.

355
30:58.520 --> 30:59.640
Here you go.

356
31:00.040 --> 31:01.000
Thank you.

357
31:01.080 --> 31:02.080
Let me take this.

358
31:07.560 --> 31:09.240
Hey, where are you?

359
31:09.320 --> 31:11.320
My cat is missing!

360
31:11.640 --> 31:13.160
I don't think I can make it.

361
31:13.240 --> 31:14.480
I'm so sorry!

362
31:15.160 --> 31:16.280
Don't worry.

363
31:16.920 --> 31:18.720
We can meet another time.

364
31:19.520 --> 31:21.080
I hope you find your cat soon.

365
31:22.640 --> 31:23.560
Thanks.

366
31:23.720 --> 31:24.800
Bye.

367
31:35.520 --> 31:37.200
Check, please.

368
31:37.720 --> 31:39.240
Sure. Just a moment.

369
31:43.240 --> 31:44.800
-Here you go. -Thank you.

370
31:48.120 --> 31:49.160
Let me treat you.

371
31:50.240 --> 31:51.640
Maybe we can go somewhere else.

372
31:51.720 --> 31:52.760
No need.

373
31:53.080 --> 31:54.160
I can pay for myself.

374
31:54.520 --> 31:55.520
We don't even know each other.

375
31:55.560 --> 31:56.840
But I want to get to know you.

376
32:32.120 --> 32:34.040
Come on. Let's go together.

377
32:38.360 --> 32:39.160
Let go of me.

378
32:39.160 --> 32:41.040
I'm not going anywhere with you. I don't even know you.

379
32:42.800 --> 32:44.160
Excuse me.

380
32:45.800 --> 32:46.960
Please excuse us.

381
32:48.080 --> 32:49.040
You're drunk.

382
32:49.440 --> 32:50.840
-Let go! -Don't struggle.

383
32:50.920 --> 32:51.920
Let me go!

384
32:54.440 --> 32:55.640
This has nothing to do with you.

385
32:55.720 --> 32:56.760
She's mine.

386
32:56.840 --> 32:58.120
So I have to get involved.

387
33:00.040 --> 33:01.480
Deal with this,

388
33:01.560 --> 33:02.880
and take care of Mr. Nont.

389
33:03.400 --> 33:04.480
Of course.

390
33:53.960 --> 33:55.520
Why did you get so drunk?

391
33:56.440 --> 33:58.760
You have a boyfriend, yet you're still flirting with everyone?

392
33:58.920 --> 34:00.080
What's that about?

393
34:00.280 --> 34:02.000
Were you looking for your next target?

394
34:04.560 --> 34:06.480
How did you turn out like this?

395
34:08.040 --> 34:10.400
Listen to yourself!

396
34:11.280 --> 34:13.320
Are you trying to kill me

397
34:14.120 --> 34:15.719
with your words?

398
34:15.960 --> 34:16.800
You--

399
34:19.239 --> 34:20.719
You keep cursing at me!

400
34:21.320 --> 34:22.639
Are you crazy, huh?

401
34:24.080 --> 34:25.400
Who are you calling crazy?

402
34:25.719 --> 34:28.000
You think you're the only one who got hurt?

403
34:28.840 --> 34:29.920
Do you know…

404
34:31.239 --> 34:32.840
I…

405
34:35.560 --> 34:36.600
I…

406
34:36.960 --> 34:39.159
didn't actually want to break up.

407
34:43.159 --> 34:44.560
I did it…

408
34:46.080 --> 34:47.320
because…

409
34:48.880 --> 34:50.080
because…

410
34:50.159 --> 34:51.320
because…

411
34:55.920 --> 34:56.520
Huh?

412
34:57.200 --> 34:57.880
Oh?

413
34:58.760 --> 34:59.440
Oh!

414
35:01.080 --> 35:02.080
Because of what?

415
35:02.160 --> 35:03.360
Wake up!

416
35:11.360 --> 35:12.200
What the…

417
35:12.960 --> 35:13.960
She's fallen asleep.

418
35:22.160 --> 35:26.320
♪ I want to surrender to every voice in my heart ♪

419
35:26.320 --> 35:28.840
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

420
35:28.840 --> 35:32.320
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

421
35:32.400 --> 35:37.560
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

422
35:37.640 --> 35:40.880
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

423
35:40.960 --> 35:45.120
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

424
35:45.400 --> 35:52.400
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

425
35:53.320 --> 35:59.680
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪

426
36:28.120 --> 36:28.720
Hey!

427
36:47.400 --> 36:48.320
Are you pretending to be asleep?

428
36:48.880 --> 36:49.880
How can you kick me like that?

429
37:18.520 --> 37:19.480
Hello?

430
37:20.200 --> 37:21.080
Oh?

431
37:21.440 --> 37:24.480
Where are you? You said you'd come home last night.

432
37:30.720 --> 37:31.480
Oh?

433
37:32.160 --> 37:33.160
Uh…

434
37:34.360 --> 37:35.040
Ong,

435
37:36.760 --> 37:37.920
I'll call you back.

436
37:39.120 --> 37:41.360
Uh, okay.

437
38:26.120 --> 38:27.640
About last night…

438
38:27.720 --> 38:30.240
-I'd like to-- -That's how you roll, huh?

439
38:32.720 --> 38:34.720
Sorry for interrupting.

440
38:35.560 --> 38:38.560
I was just worried you'd bring home some germs and infect my mother.

441
38:42.640 --> 38:43.760
Don't worry.

442
38:44.720 --> 38:46.320
I'll take care of myself.

443
38:47.000 --> 38:49.920
I won't let my personal needs cause any more trouble.

444
38:51.040 --> 38:53.240
Thank you for letting me stay here.

445
38:55.960 --> 38:57.120
No problem.

446
38:57.680 --> 39:00.240
I bring women here all the time.

447
39:03.240 --> 39:04.840
But don't expect me to drive you home.

448
39:10.280 --> 39:11.760
ONG

449
39:13.080 --> 39:14.600
A new fling?

450
39:17.360 --> 39:18.360
Go on.

451
39:27.760 --> 39:29.160
Then I'll get going.

452
39:53.000 --> 39:54.720
Anything else for me to sign?

453
39:55.200 --> 39:56.320
That's everything.

454
39:57.320 --> 39:58.360
And meetings?

455
39:58.720 --> 39:59.840
Nothing else today.

456
40:04.760 --> 40:05.680
Okay.

457
40:05.760 --> 40:07.400
I'm heading to my mother's place.

458
40:07.480 --> 40:08.960
Call me if anything comes up.

459
40:10.120 --> 40:10.880
Yes, Ms. Song.

460
40:19.440 --> 40:20.960
Going there again…

461
40:25.360 --> 40:26.880
Five.

462
40:27.360 --> 40:28.640
-Six. -Six.

463
40:29.640 --> 40:30.680
Seven.

464
40:31.480 --> 40:32.480
Well done.

465
40:33.480 --> 40:34.560
Eight.

466
40:35.560 --> 40:36.840
A little further.

467
40:38.080 --> 40:39.360
-Nine. -Nine.

468
40:39.560 --> 40:41.200
Good job, ma'am!

469
40:43.120 --> 40:44.280
Ten.

470
40:44.360 --> 40:45.760
A bit higher.

471
40:47.200 --> 40:48.320
About this high?

472
40:48.400 --> 40:49.440
Yes.

473
40:51.480 --> 40:53.760
-Thirteen. -Thirteen.

474
40:54.600 --> 40:55.520
Fourteen.

475
40:55.600 --> 40:57.000
Hello, Ms. Song.

476
41:08.800 --> 41:10.440
It's your second daughter, ma'am.

477
41:16.720 --> 41:17.840
Song!

478
41:23.240 --> 41:24.720
How are you, honey?

479
41:25.200 --> 41:26.520
Mom, have you eaten?

480
41:27.400 --> 41:28.400
Hmm…

481
41:30.680 --> 41:31.720
I have.

482
41:32.600 --> 41:34.360
That's right. I have.

483
41:35.880 --> 41:37.200
Dr. Smith and Oh

484
41:37.280 --> 41:39.240
have been taking good care of me.

485
41:39.840 --> 41:40.760
Thank you.

486
41:43.520 --> 41:46.000
They're so sweet.

487
41:46.600 --> 41:48.040
And they look good together.

488
41:49.080 --> 41:50.280
Don't you think so?

489
41:58.400 --> 42:00.760
I'll see Dr. Smith out first, Mom.

490
42:01.680 --> 42:02.840
That's nice of you.

491
42:03.600 --> 42:05.200
Thank you so much, Dr. Smith.

492
42:05.960 --> 42:07.160
Of course, ma'am.

493
42:07.600 --> 42:09.880
I'll be going now.

494
42:09.960 --> 42:11.520
-All right. -Goodbye.

495
42:13.360 --> 42:14.760
See you later, Oh.

496
42:17.160 --> 42:18.760
Let me lower the bed for you.

497
42:18.840 --> 42:19.840
Thanks.

498
42:21.880 --> 42:23.640
Just a little lower.

499
42:23.720 --> 42:24.960
Of course.

500
42:25.040 --> 42:27.000
-Is this low enough? -That's good.

501
42:39.440 --> 42:41.360
How's my mother doing?

502
42:41.880 --> 42:44.560
Her Alzheimer's symptoms seem to have improved.

503
42:44.960 --> 42:46.800
Her muscles haven't wasted away,

504
42:47.440 --> 42:49.320
and she hasn't developed any pressure sores.

505
42:54.160 --> 42:56.280
When will you come here next?

506
42:57.800 --> 42:59.240
As scheduled, next week.

507
42:59.800 --> 43:01.400
Then stick to the schedule.

508
43:01.480 --> 43:02.960
Don't come before then.

509
43:04.520 --> 43:06.600
Oh, okay.

510
43:09.720 --> 43:10.600
Then…

511
43:10.840 --> 43:12.280
I'll walk you to your car.

512
43:13.120 --> 43:13.720
Thanks.

513
43:15.880 --> 43:17.280
I'll be going now, Ms. Song.

514
43:19.560 --> 43:20.320
Let's go.

515
43:29.520 --> 43:30.200
Oh,

516
43:31.000 --> 43:32.600
I was so busy checking on Madam

517
43:32.680 --> 43:34.160
that I forgot to tell you something.

518
43:34.240 --> 43:37.120
Ong brought your mother in for a checkup this morning.

519
43:37.200 --> 43:39.560
Her blood test results are better than last time.

520
43:40.760 --> 43:44.000
Her blood counts have also returned to acceptable levels.

521
43:44.560 --> 43:46.680
There are no new abnormalities

522
43:47.000 --> 43:49.560
or signs of infection.

523
43:50.320 --> 43:52.280
That means the treatment has been working so far.

524
43:52.440 --> 43:53.400
Really?

525
43:53.680 --> 43:54.480
Yes.

526
43:55.280 --> 43:57.520
But she still needs to take her medication

527
43:58.160 --> 43:59.920
and attend all her follow-up appointments.

528
44:00.320 --> 44:02.240
She also needs to avoid infections.

529
44:03.200 --> 44:04.640
If she has a fever or feels unwell,

530
44:04.640 --> 44:06.480
bring her to the hospital right away.

531
44:07.680 --> 44:09.520
Thank you so much, Smith.

532
44:17.600 --> 44:18.680
I promised, didn't I?

533
44:18.680 --> 44:20.760
I'd do my best to look after her.

534
44:29.120 --> 44:30.000
See you.

535
44:30.440 --> 44:31.440
See you.

536
45:03.000 --> 45:05.160
Your smile disappears the moment you see me.

537
45:06.120 --> 45:08.680
What did Smith do to make you smile like that?

538
45:10.880 --> 45:13.040
You must be dying to become a doctor's wife.

539
45:24.600 --> 45:26.680
How long are you going to keep walking away?

540
45:26.720 --> 45:27.960
I don't want to fight.

541
45:28.040 --> 45:29.160
But I do.

542
45:29.280 --> 45:30.800
Are you insane?

543
45:31.360 --> 45:32.800
Please get out of my room.

544
45:33.160 --> 45:34.240
Right.

545
45:34.440 --> 45:36.240
You're quick to throw me out.

546
45:36.520 --> 45:38.600
If it were Smith, you'd--

547
45:38.600 --> 45:39.440
That's right!

548
45:39.520 --> 45:41.560
If it were him, it'd be better than this.

549
45:41.640 --> 45:42.560
Satisfied?

550
45:51.600 --> 45:53.880
At least he respects me,

551
45:55.000 --> 45:56.680
doesn't look down on me,

552
45:57.280 --> 45:58.840
and doesn't use force against me!

553
46:48.120 --> 46:49.880
So you really don't want me anymore?

554
46:51.360 --> 46:56.080
♪ I want to tell you so you'll understand ♪

555
46:56.160 --> 47:00.160
♪ But how much longer ♪

556
47:00.800 --> 47:05.000
♪ Can I keep all these words inside? ♪

557
47:05.920 --> 47:09.840
♪ Every time we meet ♪

558
47:10.520 --> 47:13.080
♪ How can I keep pretending… ♪

559
47:14.520 --> 47:15.600
Cream called.

560
47:15.600 --> 47:17.320
Mr. Sam is back at the house.

561
47:18.120 --> 47:19.400
A used item

562
47:19.480 --> 47:21.400
shouldn't even cost this much.

563
47:22.080 --> 47:23.520
I've even thrown in an extra.

564
47:24.160 --> 47:25.760
You're not the Song I knew.

565
47:26.160 --> 47:27.760
Stop acting innocent.

566
47:27.840 --> 47:28.760
Get out!

567
47:28.840 --> 47:30.280
What's wrong with you?

568
47:30.360 --> 47:31.680
I said get out!

569
47:32.800 --> 47:34.240
If you hate me this much,

570
47:34.240 --> 47:35.960
why keep me here as your eyesore?

571
47:36.080 --> 47:38.000
A hired hand has no right to ask me that.

572
47:39.840 --> 47:41.760
Oh? What's wrong? Oh!

573
47:42.080 --> 47:44.560
♪ But my mouth denies my heart ♪

574
47:44.560 --> 47:48.120
♪ Never speaking the truth ♪

575
47:48.200 --> 47:53.320
♪ Even though everything I do ♪

576
47:53.400 --> 47:56.520
♪ Is telling you I love you ♪

577
47:56.600 --> 48:01.040
♪ I give in every time our eyes meet ♪

578
48:01.120 --> 48:09.240
♪ But I'm unable to show it ♪

579
48:09.240 --> 48:15.240
♪ I want to say "I love you" for once, Just like how I feel ♪
